     },
     "body": "<p>It's the OAI DC schema.  www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc.xsd - xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/</p>\n\n<p>There's a copy in the fcrepo-server/src/main/resources/xsd directory</p>",
