      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Off the top of my head, my suggestion would be to enable validation only at ingest (leave old content be) and document the new behavior loudly!</p>\n\n<p>Factoring out XML services would be exactly the kind of place that OSGi whiteboard pattern μservices really shine. Might be a good place to \"put in the thin end of the wedge\" towards OSGi. I'll raise the question at the next committers' call and perhaps we'll open an issue.</p>",
